From 18916896604ef7934670495b3794d838b7963efd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 09:19:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/89] Add extended charts to Stats

The overview has always stopped at six of each, which is a summary rather
than a chart. A collapsible section below it now goes to 20, 50 or 100 -
the DAOs already took a limit, so this is the same query with the cap
lifted, not new SQL.

The overview is untouched: this sits underneath it.

While collapsed the longer queries do not run at all. They are the same
joins as the overview, and re-running them on every period change for a
section nobody has opened is work for nothing.

Extended list keys are prefixed, because the overview above holds the
same songs and two items sharing a key in one LazyColumn is a crash
rather than a cosmetic problem. Artist artwork is fetched for the longer
list too - it reaches artists the overview never showed, which are
exactly the ones most likely to be missing a picture.
---
