From: claude <claude@local>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:16:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 50/89] Keep the Discord card layout when paused, add an
 auto-clear timeout

Pausing dropped both startTime and endTime, which also removes the
whole progress-bar row from the card - Discord reshapes the embed
around whatever timestamps it's given. Keep sending them so the row
stays put; the tradeoff is the counter keeps ticking during the pause
instead of freezing exactly, which Discord's RPC schema has no way to
express. The "Paused" label swap already covers the state change.

Also add a per-user "clear presence after N minutes paused" setting
(0 = never), since there was previously no way to have a stale paused
presence go away on its own.
