Subject: [PATCH 59/89] Show each song's own listen time/play count on the
 stats screen

The stats screen already had a chip toggle to rank by time listened
vs. play count, but that only changed the sort order - it never
actually showed either number, so there was no way to see what the
ranking meant for a given song. mostPlayedSongs()'s query already
computed both aggregates per song to sort by; it just discarded them
before returning.

Added mostPlayedSongsWithStats(), the same query keeping totalPlayTime
and totalPlays instead of throwing them away (SongPlayStats wraps a
Song with them), and a SongListItem.extraInfo slot to show the value
matching whichever metric is currently selected, right where you'd
expect it: beside the 3-dot menu.
